Author: Capplequoppe <hallgren@live.se>
Date:   Mon Sep 14 20:12:40 2026 +0200

    fix(F1): wire RETIRED_LESSONS into migrateLessonIdentity

    Task 4.3 retired legacy lesson numbers 15-25 into RETIRED_LESSONS but
    migrateLessonIdentity only consulted the declared sequence, so any
    persisted state referencing a retired number (completedLessons,
    currentLesson, a card's lessonNumber, or a pending catch-up) still
    threw LessonIdentityMigrationError uncaught through Storage.load().
    Resolve now falls back to the absorbing lesson's position via
    RETIRED_LESSONS before refusing.

